# Standard Git ignore file for web projects

# Dependencies
/node_modules

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# Misc
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Environment variables (if they were used, though this project uses in-line key for simplicity)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.vscode


These three files provide a complete, ready-to-use repository structure for your MEDDPICC Analyzer. Simply commit them to a new GitHub repository to get started!
